  "description": "Target-aware API-versioning helpers for Trellis.Asp. WithVersionedRoute() versions Location headers from CreatedAtRoute(...), CreatedAtAction(...), and WithLocation(...) using the destination's actual version mappings. Supports query values and URL-segment parameters, including explicit segment pins. Neutral and missing-metadata destinations skip injection and remove supplied api-version values. PageUrl supplies version-aware pagination links while retaining ambient segment routing and rejecting explicit segment pins.",
